          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne mumbali tsiabaana baDani tsiabakhaya; kho abaana baDani batikulukha nibaseera Leshemu nibalibukula, nibalikhupa netsinganga; nibalilia nibamenyamwo, nibakulikha Leshemu mbu Dani, khulwa eliira liaDani kuuka wabwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
