          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lilako IiOMWAMI shinga olwa liali, nolwa bamuheelesia litaala elia yasaba, mbu Timinatsi-sera, mushialo shiebikulu shiaEferaimu; naye niyoombakha litaala tsana namenyamwo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
