              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obwo nibwo obulaame bwosi obwa Eleazari omukuhani naYoswa waNuni nabeemilisi bebi-libwa bietsimbia tsiabaana baIsiraeli bakabula bube obulaame, munjila yokhuupa ikha, eShiilo imbeli wOMWAMI, hamuliango weliheema liokhwakaana. Kho nibamalilisia okhukaba eshialo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
